Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: minti-pack-mistral
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 minti-pack-fetch (>= 0.1)
Recommends:
 ollama
Description: MINTI addon — Mistral 7B Instruct chat model
 Pulls the Mistral 7B Instruct v0.3 chat model into the local Ollama install
 via `minti-pack-fetch mistral`. Once installed, minti-runtime and any
 client of /v1/chat/completions can address it as `mistral:7b`.
 .
 Size: ~4.1 GB on disk, ~4.5 GB RAM at load (Q4_K_M quant). Slightly smaller
 footprint than Hermes 3 8B; the two coexist on an 8 GB RAM host with one
 loaded at a time.
 .
 Postinst calls `minti-pack-fetch mistral`. Set MINTI_PACK_NO_FETCH=1 in the
 environment when installing to defer the actual download — the operator
 then runs `sudo minti-pack-fetch mistral` when bandwidth and disk allow.
